Package: drevotalkR
Type: Package
Title: TreeTalker Data Processing, Ecosystem Services, and Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alexey", "Yaroslavtsev", email = "yaroslavtsevam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance processing of raw TreeTalker (TT+ v2/v3, TT-Soil,
    TT-Reference, TTG, TT-Cloud) sensor streams and SD-card backups using
    'data.table' internally while returning standard 'data.frame' objects.
    Converts raw signals into calibrated biophysical parameters (sap flux
    density, whole-tree transpiration, stem and soil water content, radial
    growth, 12-band spectral vegetation indices, 3D inclination angles),
    transforms them into ecosystem service indicators (urban canopy cooling
    and humidifying, water regulation, biomass and carbon sequestration,
    biomechanical wind stability), and generates standard 'ggplot2'
    visualizations with switchable English and Russian labels.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/yaroslavtsevam/drevotalkR
BugReports: https://github.com/yaroslavtsevam/drevotalkR/issues
